.TH RATASH-PROFILE-REMOVE 1 2026-08-01 "Ratash 0.1.3" "Ratash User Commands"
.SH NAME
ratash\-profile\-remove \- Remove an Inactive Profile
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBratash profile remove\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROFILE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove an Inactive Profile
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROFILE\fR>
Opaque Profile ID or unique case\-sensitive display name
